      "expected_source_rows": 363,
      "last_source_update": "2026-09-04",
      "last_source_update_basis": "dated official resource",
      "notes": "The official source repeats companies across numbered sectors. The audited 670 sector rows yield 363 source-backed observations after grouping only repetitions that share company identity, outcome and normalised date pair. Four company identity/outcome groups contain conflicting date pairs across sectors, so those pairs remain distinct observations rather than being resolved or collapsed. Explicit ordinal/layout date typography is normalised without changing source digits. A malformed 65.5.2026 variant is retained in provenance; it is associated with the unique clean repeated date pair only because the same source identity/outcome has exactly one complete pair. Source identifiers are preserved verbatim and unusual numeric lengths are never padded or truncated."
    },
